<title>SWITZERLAND: SOCCER-SIXTY CLUBS ENTER INTERTOTO CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SIXTY CLUBS ENTER INTERTOTO CUP.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>UEFA said on Tuesday 60 club sides from 33 countries would compete in this year's Intertoto Cup but soccer associations from England, Italy and Spain had declined to take part.</p>
<p>France, Germany and Belgium top the list of entries with four teams each while Russia, Turkey, Austria, Yugoslavia and Denmark will each receive three berths.</p>
</text>
